# Ignore rules for the `dsh-smith` package and the preset it ships.
#
# This repository is not a harness home. Four patterns a session-rooted project
# would need are deliberately ABSENT here — `.dsh/`, `sessions/`, `storages/`, and
# `.credentials.yaml` / `settings.yaml` — because they describe `$DSH_HOME`, which
# is a different directory entirely, and nothing under this root ever produces
# them. Leaving them in would suppress a real file of that name if one ever
# appeared here, and would imply this tree holds session state it does not.

# Node
node_modules/
npm-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
pnpm-debug.log*

# Editor and OS noise
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
.idea/
.vscode/
*.swp

# Secrets — kept because a stray key must never be committed, whatever the layout
.env
.env.*
*.pem
*.key
